{"toolCallId":"call_94ef1a8869ba4673a3858e83288e8915","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"- Level 3+: Must have at least 3/4 components (error if fewer)\n- Phase parent: skipped. Under the lean trio policy its `plan.md` and `tasks.md` live in the child folders, which carry the protocol.\n\n### Detection Patterns\n\n```markdown\n## AI EXECUTION PROTOCOL         ← Main section\n### Pre-Task Checklist           ← Component 1\n### Execution Rules              ← Component 2\n### Status Reporting Format      ← Component 3\n### Blocked Task Protocol        ← Component 4\n```\n\n### Examples\n\n**Pass (Level 3+):**\n```markdown\n## AI EXECUTION PROTOCOL\n\n### Pre-Task Checklist\n- [ ] Read relevant files\n- [ ] Verify preconditions\n\n### Execution Rules\n| Rule | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| TASK-SEQ | Complete tasks in order |\n| TASK-SCOPE | Only modify files in scope |\n\n### Status Reporting Format\nAfter each task: \"Task T## complete. Files modified: [list]\"\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"b2b0a2","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
{"toolCallId":"call_9bab0223c67e45438e45a06b38a93097","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"\nSpec Folder Validation v3.0.0\n\n  Folder: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree/specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n  Level:  3\n  Engine: orchestrator\n\n+ FILE_EXISTS: All required files present for Level 3\n+ PLACEHOLDER_FILLED: No unfilled template placeholders found\n+ TEMPLATE_SOURCE: Template source headers present\n+ ANCHORS_VALID: Anchors well formed in 5 file(s)\n+ FRONTMATTER_VALID: Frontmatter continuity basics present\n+ FRONTMATTER_MEMORY_BLOCK: All spec-doc frontmatter memory blocks are structurally valid\n+ SPEC_DOC_SUFFICIENCY: All targeted spec-doc anchors meet the sufficiency baseline\n+ MERGE_LEGALITY: No merge plan supplied; legality check skipped\n+ CROSS_ANCHOR_CONTAMINATION: No routing payload supplied; contamination check skipped\n+ POST_SAVE_FINGERPRINT: No post-save payload supplied; fingerprint check skipped\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_PRESENT: Graph metadata checked\n+ GENERATED_METADATA_INTEGRITY: Generated metadata passed schema, status-enum and path-prefix invariants\n+ GENERATED_METADATA_DRIFT: Generated synopsis fields match the current docs\n+ COMMENT_HYGIENE_MARKER: No ephemeral comment-hygiene markers found\n+ SCAFFOLD_NEVER_TOUCHED: Spec status is 'Draft', not Complete; scaffold markers are allowed\n+ STATUS_CROSS_DOC_CONSISTENCY: status cross-doc check not applicable; one status is missing or unclassified\n    - spec.md Status=Draft classified=planned\n    - implementation-summary.md Status=<missing> classified=unknown\n+ AC_COVERAGE: Acceptance coverage gate not active for this level or lifecycle state\n+ TOC_POLICY: TOC policy passed: no TOC headings in non-research spec documents\n! AI_PROTOCOLS: AI protocol incomplete (0/4 components)\n    - Level 3 should include AI Execution Protocol section\n    - Missing Pre-Task Checklist\n    - Missing Execution Rules table\n    - Missing Status Reporting Format\n    - Missing Blocked Task Protocol\n+ COMPLEXITY_MATCH: Complexity level consistent with content (Level 3; phases=3, tasks=60, stories=2, scenarios=0)\n+ FOLDER_NAMING: Folder name '001-recommend-level-quiet-flag' follows naming convention\n+ FRONTMATTER_VALUES: Frontmatter values are in the shared list\n+ SOURCE_TAGS: No [SOURCE:] path:line citations in research or review artifacts\n+ GREP_CONVENTION: Grep convention: 5 document(s) conform\n+ LEVEL_MATCH: Level consistent across all files (Level 3)\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_CHILD_DRIFT: children_ids matches the on-disk phase children\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_CHILD_IDENTITY: children_ids entries all carry the packet's own identity\n+ GRAPH_METADATA_SHAPE: graph-metadata.json shape validation passed\n+ METADATA_DISK_PATH_CONSISTENCY: metadata paths carry the scaffold marker; the packet is not filed yet\n+ DESCRIPTION_SHAPE: description.json shape validation passed\n+ NORMALIZER_LINT: No local normalizeScope*/getOptionalString declarations found outside allowed files\n+ SPEC_DOC_INTEGRITY: Spec doc references, metadata, and handover targets resolve cleanly\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_ROOT_SPEC_REQUIRED: Canonical-save root-spec check not applicable to this folder\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_SOURCE_DOCS_REQUIRED: Canonical-save source-doc check not applicable to this folder\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_LINEAGE_REQUIRED: save_lineage is present for the refreshed graph metadata\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_PACKET_IDENTITY_NORMALIZED: Packet identity normalization drift detected (soft detector)\n    - identity=scaffold/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n    - identity=zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag\n+ CANONICAL_SAVE_DESCRIPTION_GRAPH_FRESHNESS: Description and graph freshness stay within the canonical-save slack window\n+ CONTINUITY_FRESHNESS: Continuity freshness skipped: SPECKIT_COMPLETION_FRESHNESS is not enabled\n    - code:not_opted_in\n+ LINKS_VALID: All wikilinks under the system-spec-kit skill resolve\n\nSummary: Errors: 0  Warnings: 1\n\nRESULT: PASSED\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"6380bf","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
{"toolCallId":"call_9efc6d5bfd2f4ea38ff9755014d368da","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"**Acceptance criteria:** see `acceptance-criteria.md` (AC-003).\n\n---\n\n### US-003: Keep a tool result small (Priority: P1)\n\n**As an** agent running the script inside a tool call, **I want** the quiet form to stay one line, **so that** the result does not crowd out the work it informs.\n\n**Acceptance criteria:** see `acceptance-criteria.md` (AC-005, AC-006).\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:questions -->\n## 12. OPEN QUESTIONS\n\n- Should `--quiet` also trim the JSON payload? Resolved: no. `--json` already emits one structured document, so a third payload shape would be a second schema to keep in step (ADR-001 in `plan.md`).\n- Should quiet mode keep the score line alongside the level line? Resolved: no. One line, because the point of the flag is a stable single-line answer (ADR-002 in `plan.md`).\n- Does the short alias earn its place? Resolved: yes, `-q`, matching the existing `-j` and `-h` precedent (ADR-003 in `plan.md`).\n- Remaining questions: none.\n<!-- /ANCHOR:questions -->\n\n---\n\n## RELATED DOCUMENTS\n\n- **Implementation Plan**: See `plan.md`\n- **Task Breakdown**: See `tasks.md`\n- **Verification Checklist**: See `tasks.md`\n- **Decision Records**: See the ADR section of `plan.md`. `decision-record.md` is an on-demand document and this packet does not add one.\n\n---\n\n=== plan tail ===\n### ADR-003: `--quiet` is canonical, `-q` is an alias\n\n**Status**: Accepted\n\n**Context**: `-j` and `-h` already set a precedent for short forms, so a long-only flag would read as an oversight. `-q` is unclaimed in the current parser.\n\n**Decision**: Support both spellings in one `case` arm, document `--quiet` as canonical, and treat `-q` as convenience.\n\n**Consequences**:\n- Consistent with the two existing short forms.\n- One more token in the single-letter space, documented so a future option does not take it silently.\n\n**Alternatives Rejected**:\n- Long form only: defensible, but it makes the flag set look inconsistent for no gain.\n- Add a general `-v`/`-q` verbosity pair: a second axis nobody asked for, and the JSON mode already covers structured output.\n\n---\n\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"296ec3","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
